    <string name="faq.title">FAQ</string>
    <string name="faq.entry">FAQ</string>
    <string name="faq.q1">How do I add photos and assign them to chapters?</string>
    <string name="faq.a1">Add photos in the Photo Library, then select them and assign to a chapter. One photo can belong to several chapters; unassigned photos are listed separately.</string>
    <string name="faq.q2">How do I export a PDF album?</string>
    <string name="faq.a2">Choose \"Export PDF\" from the share menu on the person page to preview, save or share it. You\'ll be asked to confirm chapter order if it looks off.</string>
    <string name="faq.q3">Where is my data stored? Is it safe?</string>
    <string name="faq.a3">Everything stays on this device and is never uploaded to a server. You can enable FaceID lock in Settings.</string>
    <string name="faq.q4">How do I back up or move to a new phone?</string>
    <string name="faq.a4">Use \"Export Archive\" to create a zip to save or forward, then \"Import Archive\" on the new device to restore everything.</string>
    <string name="faq.q5">How do I record a voice narration?</string>
    <string name="faq.a5">Tap the microphone under \"Life Narration\" on the person page, or on a chapter or photo, to record and replay.</string>
    <string name="faq.q6">How do I set background music?</string>
    <string name="faq.a6">Pick a local track as background music when editing the person; it plays continuously when you open the page.</string>
    <string name="faq.q7">How do I put two photos side by side on one page?</string>
    <string name="faq.a7">Turn on \"Pair with next photo\" in the photo editor; those two will share a page in the PDF. Otherwise each photo gets its own page.</string>
    <string name="faq.q8">What\'s the difference between free and Pro?</string>
    <string name="faq.a8">The free version records basic content; Pro unlocks PDF export and more chapters/photos. See the subscription page.</string>
